  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "librarian-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": -200,
      "width": 4580,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "# Librarian Shared L2 Ingestion & Governance Pipeline (Proposed To-Be)\n**Symptom:** Prior draft hid distinct Context 1/2/3 entry callers inside one trigger switch, overloaded Owner with 7 main-path steps & 3 serial Gate-2 prompts, risked blocking external Tier 0 on curate, and skipped final Oracle on code-only roots.\n**Root cause:** Accept narrowed parent mandates from Context 1/2/3 or scheduler (never widening parent scope), delegate routine screening & acceptance via Lead + Oracle (GLM-5.3) + 4-point Doctor, consolidate Gate 2, and emit canonical 5-outcome receipts + tickets.\nLanes are actors; red arrows are extensions (numbered); red ends are ways the use case ends without success; orange cards call another use case. Generated from `librarian-ingestion-tobe.spec.yaml`."
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-s",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 70,
      "text": "● start",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-admit_mandate",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3040,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**1.** admits narrowed L2 mandate, parent spec_owner, budget & commissioned_by provenance (no widen)"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-leadbind",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 640,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
